# NAT Gateway Kya Karta Hai?

NAT Gateway Private EC2 ko Internet use karne deta hai, lekin Internet se koi Private EC2 ko directly access nahi kar sakta.

>Easy Memory Trick
🏠 Private EC2 = Ghar ke andar ka employe
🚪 NAT Gateway = Office ka Exit Gate
Employee bahar ja sakta hai. ✅
Bahar wala employee ke room me nahi aa sakta. ❌

>Q. Why do we use NAT Gateway?
NAT Gateway allows instances in a private subnet to access the internet for outbound traffic, such as downloading software updates or accessing AWS services, while preventing inbound connections from the internet.